{#- Shared head essentials for every base layout: favicon set + early behavior fixes. #}
{#- Disable the browser's scroll-position restore on reload/back-forward so every page opens
    at the top instead of jumping to the previous scroll position. Runs in <head> before any
    paint so restoration never kicks in. #}
<script>if ("scrollRestoration" in history) history.scrollRestoration = "manual";</script>
{#- Favicon set. Assets live in public/ (Vite copies as-is).
    favicon.svg is the source of truth; rasterize with macOS `sips` (ImageMagick's SVG renderer
    breaks the chevron's matrix transform), then package ICO: magick favicon-{16x16,32x32,48x48}.png favicon.ico -#}
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="48x48">
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="/favicon-16x16.png">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicon-32x32.png">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="48x48" href="/favicon-48x48.png">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="96x96" href="/favicon-96x96.png">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="192x192" href="/favicon-192x192.png">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="256x256" href="/favicon-256x256.png">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="512x512" href="/favicon-512x512.png">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/apple-touch-icon.png">
